 expensive_result\nFROM PreCalculated\nWHERE expensive_result > 100;\n```\n"""'}], 'response': 'Step 1: The given SQL query does not contain any repeated function calls or operations within the SELECT, WHERE, JOIN conditions, or any part of the query that is executed multiple times for the same row. Therefore, Rule 1 does not match the SQL query.\n\nSince there are no matched rules, there will be no Query Rewrite explanations provided.', 'time': 8.950494527816772}
